;; `atomically` used to be dispatched only at `len == 2`, so every other arity
;; fell out of the special-form table and reported `unknown function or
;; operator 'atomically'` -- a wrong diagnostic for an arity mistake.  The row
;; is ungated now, so a bare `(atomically)` gets a real arity error.
(defn main [] : int
  (atomically)
  0)
